cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its method, please cite it as below."
title: "osv-resolver"
abstract: >-
  Resolves an OSV vulnerability advisory to its fixing commit and uses the
  maintainer's own regression test to reproduce the bug: the test fails on the
  commit before the fix and passes on the fix.
authors:
